  AdText: GROW YOUR SPIRIT AND FINANCES
  OverrideDialogue:
  - OverrideDay: 1
    ReplacementDialogue: 'Your <b>awakening</b> is an important milestone in your
      migration into Flock.<n>

      It''s the first time you get to learn any
      <b>real</b> secrets!<n>

      My secret for you is: Why we value the <color=yellow><b>stars</b></color>!<n>

      You
      see, amongst them is where our <color=87F8FA>God</color> lives!<n>

      A
      <color=87F8FA>God</color> that once walked this planet like you do now!<n>

      But
      that''s all you get to know for now.<n>

      Enjoy your paperwork!'
